<Layout title="Cookies | Linis Co"><article class="wrap detail-hero privacy"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR BROWSING EXPERIENCE</div><h1>Cookies</h1><p>The Linis Co website does not set advertising or analytics cookies, and does not currently use analytics or advertising trackers. The enquiry form prepares your message in your browser and does not store it on our server.</p><h2>Hosting and sign-in</h2><p>This preview is hosted on ChatGPT Sites. The hosting provider may use essential cookies for sign-in, access control and security. These are managed by the provider.</p><h2>Images and external links</h2><p>Illustrative photography loads from Unsplash. Your browser shares standard request information with the image provider. Following links to Messenger, Facebook or other websites takes you to services with their own cookie and privacy policies.</p><h2>Your controls</h2><p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Blocking essential hosting cookies may prevent access to the private preview. Contact Linis Co at <a href="tel:+639618062218">+63 961 806 2218</a> with questions about this website.</p><a class="text-link" href="/privacy">Read our privacy & enquiry notice →</a></article></Layout>
